mariamem third-party inventory (initial local alpha)

Component                      License / treatment
MariaDB / lite4mariadb guest    GPL-2.0-only; modified source and build scripts
                               must accompany binary distribution as required.
wolfSSL bundled by MariaDB     GPLv3 with a GPLv2 election for combination with
                               MariaDB Server in its LICENSING file. Preserve
                               both COPYING and LICENSING.
PCRE2 10.47, zlib, fmt 12.2.0  License texts are included in licenses/ and their
                               sources are retained by the input lock/archive.
                               Final linked-file inventory remains pending.
WASIX libc v2026-07-03.1        Upstream multi-license notices and musl/cloudlibc
                               notices are included. Recursive LLVM runtime and
                               header-generator source collection remains pending.
Wasmer headless 7.4.2           MIT text verified against the v7.4.2 source; its statically
                               included Rust dependencies retain their licenses.
Go runtime                     BSD-3-Clause; bundled Go LICENSE included.
shibukawa/pgmem fixture design MIT; copyright and permission notice included.
PyMySQL / pytest / xdist       Optional dependencies, not copied into the wheel.

The native bundle has no libmariadbd dynamic dependency: MariaDB and the C
wrapper are compiled into the WASM/AOT guest. Python communicates with the Go
host, which uses a separate Wasmer process. The project chooses GPL-2.0-only
for its own code rather than claiming this process boundary exempts all parts.

License texts are in licenses/. This list is not yet a complete SBOM of the
prebuilt Wasmer release or the WASIX sysroot. Do not treat this local alpha as
ready for public release merely because a wheel can be built.
